['|Case|:**registration**\n   ```python\n   FUNCTION register(username: str, password: str) -> bool\n       IF username exists in users\n           RETURN False\n       ENDIF\n       Add username and password to self.users\n       Open users.txt with append mode\n           Write username and password to users.txt\n       Close file\n       RETURN True\n   END FUNCTION\n\n   @app.route(\'/register\', methods=[\'GET\', \'POST\'])\n   FUNCTION register_route()\n       IF request.method == \'POST\'\n           username = request.form[\'username\']\n           password = request.form[\'password\']\n           IF register(username, password) == True\n               Redirect to login\n           ELSE\n               Display "Username already exists."\n           ENDIF\n       ENDIF\n       Render registration.html\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n|Case|:**logout**\n   ```python\n   @app.route(\'/logout\')\n   FUNCTION logout()\n       Remove username from session\n       Redirect to login\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n', "|Case|:**view_reading_list**\n   ```python\n   @app.route('/reading_list')\n   FUNCTION reading_list()\n       IF username is not in session\n           Redirect to login\n       ENDIF\n       Fetch reading list for username\n       Render reading_list.html with books\n   END FUNCTION\n\n   FUNCTION get_reading_list(username: str)\n       Initialize reading_list as empty list\n       IF reading_list.txt exists\n           Open reading_list.txt\n               For each line\n                   Split line into user and book_title\n                   IF user matches username\n                       Append book_title to reading_list\n                   ENDIF\n               END FOR\n           Close file\n       ENDIF\n       RETURN reading_list\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n|Case|:**view_book_details**\n   ```python\n   @app.route('/book/<title>')\n   FUNCTION book_details(title)\n       book = get_book_details(title)\n       Render book_details.html with book\n   END FUNCTION\n\n   FUNCTION get_book_details(title: str)\n       FOR each book in self.books\n           IF book.title == title\n               RETURN book\n           ENDIF\n       ENDFOR\n       RETURN None\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n", '|Case|:**view_detailed_information**\n   ```html\n   <!DOCTYPE html>\n   <html lang="en">\n       <head>\n           <meta charset="UTF-8">\n           <title>{{ book.title }}</title>\n       </head>\n       <body>\n           <h1>{{ book.title }}</h1>\n           <p><strong>Author:</strong> {{ book.author }}</p>\n           <p><strong>Summary:</strong> {{ book.summary }}</p>\n           <img src="{{ book.cover_image }}" alt="Cover Image">\n           <a href="/add_to_reading_list/{{ book.title }}">Add to Reading List</a>\n           <a href="/dashboard">Back to Dashboard</a>\n       </body>\n   </html>\n   ```\n\n**Key Libraries Used:**\n- **Flask**: A lightweight Python web framework used for building web applications. It simplifies routing and rendering of templates.\n- **Flask-Session**: Provides session support via various storage backends, allowing easy user session management.\n- **Jinja2**: A templating engine for rendering dynamic HTML web pages with data passed from Flask.']
